@startuml RF23_Sequencia
title RF23 — Criar as telas de configuração do usuário (Conta, Privacidade, Aparência, Idioma, Seus dados) no padrão LGPD, com i18n\nDiagrama de sequência — endpoints reais
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
}
autonumber
actor Pessoa as U
participant "Frontend\n/settings" as FE
participant "PreferencesController" as PC
participant "PreferencesService" as PS
participant "AssetCatalogService" as AC
participant "MeController" as MC
participant "AccountService" as AS
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "Storage de mídia\n(MediaStoragePort)" as ST
U -> FE: abre Configurações
FE -> PC: GET /api/me/preferences\n(Accept-Language: pt-BR|en|es)
PC -> PS: get(user)
PS -> DB: SELECT user_preferences, users
PC --> FE: 200 {theme, language, density, fontScale,\nhighContrast, reduceMotion, chromeBackgroundId, …}
FE -> FE: ThemeProvider aplica data-theme/density,\nfont-size e --chrome-bg (só o chrome, CA08)
== Aparência / Idioma ==
U -> FE: troca tema, idioma, fonte ou fundo do chrome
FE -> FE: aplica na hora + localStorage (fai.locale, tema)
FE -> PC: PUT /api/me/preferences\n{theme, language, …, clientUpdatedAt}
PC -> PS: update(user, Update)
alt clientUpdatedAt anterior ao salvo
  PS --> PC: estado atual (last-write-wins, CA02)
else validação
  PS -> AC: isChromeBackground(id) / cardSkin(id)
  alt inválido
    PS --> PC: 400 FUNDO_INVALIDO / FONTE_INVALIDA / COR_INVALIDA
  else ok
    PS -> DB: UPDATE user_preferences; audit ALTERACAO_PREFERENCIAS
    PC --> FE: 200 preferências (Content-Language)
  end
end
== Conta (vitrine, sem reautenticação) ==
U -> FE: edita nome, bio, país, avatar, capa
FE -> PC: PATCH /api/me/profile
PC -> PS: updateProfile(user, ProfileUpdate)
PS -> DB: UPDATE users
PC --> FE: 200 Views.UserCard
U -> FE: troca o @
FE -> PC: PUT /api/me/username
PC -> PS: changeUsername(user, username)
alt @ em uso ou reservado
  PS --> PC: 400 USERNAME_EM_USO {suggestions} (CA04)
else livre
  PS -> DB: UPDATE users.username
  PC --> FE: 200 {username}
end
== Privacidade (LGPD) ==
FE -> MC: GET /api/me/consents
MC -> AS: consents(user)
MC --> FE: 200 [{purpose, granted, grantedAt, …}]
U -> FE: liga/desliga uma finalidade
FE -> MC: PUT /api/me/consents/{purpose} {granted}
MC -> AS: setConsent(user, purpose, granted)
AS -> DB: UPSERT user_consents; INSERT audit_log
note right of AS : ver RF24 (motor de IA) — a finalidade\ncontrola o envio a provedores externos
== Seus dados ==
U -> FE: Exportar meus dados
FE -> MC: POST /api/me/exports
MC -> AS: requestExport(user)
AS -> DB: INSERT data_export_requests (PROCESSING)
AS -> ST: put(restricted/users/{id}/exports/{exportId}.json)
AS -> DB: UPDATE status=READY, expires_at=+7d; notifica DATA_EXPORT_READY
MC --> FE: 202 {id, status, readyAt, expiresAt, bytes}
FE -> MC: GET /api/me/exports/{exportId}/file
MC -> AS: downloadExport(user, exportId)
alt expirada ou sem arquivo
  AS --> MC: 410 EXPORTACAO_EXPIRADA
else ok
  AS -> ST: get(fileKey)
  MC --> FE: 200 application/octet-stream (fashionai-dados-{id}.zip)
end
@enduml
